+Copy windows draft from a request's own context, which agent output repeats
+often: file edits, tool arguments that quote code, paths. When a greedy
+request's prompt plus output ends with eight tokens that occurred earlier, the tokens that followed
+the latest earlier occurrence are verified that round in place of dSpark's
